130
00:05:49,451 --> 00:05:51,453
Karena kamu sibuk mengoceh. Sekarang diam.

131
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:53,121
Cam, banyak orang bilang:

132
00:05:53,221 --> 00:05:55,055
